                                "sense_id": "e7233cf0-74fc-3185-bffd-d23d5a639bd2",
                                "text": "Good barilla usually contains, according to Dr. Ure's analysis, 20 per cent. of real alkali, associated with muriates and sulphates, chiefly of soda, some lime, and alumina, with very little sulphur."
